## 36. Property-based testing

### P1 — Determinism

```text
encode(x) == encode(x)
```

### P2 — Mutation sensitivity

```text
identity_bound_change(x)
```

moet de canonical bytes veranderen.

### P3 — Round-trip

```text
decode(encode(x))
```

moet dezelfde canonical representation reconstrueren.

### P4 — Signature binding

```text
verify(x, sign(x)) == success
verify(mutated(x), sign(x)) == failure
```

### P5 — Domain separation

```text
sign(domain_A, x)
```

mag niet geldig zijn voor:

```text
domain_B
```

